🚀 Sentiment Analysis App using NLP & Machine Learning

This project is a simple yet powerful Sentiment Analysis Web App that predicts whether a text expresses Positive or Negative sentiment. Built using NLP techniques, TF-IDF vectorization, and a Logistic Regression model, then deployed with Streamlit for an interactive user experience.

🔹 Features
✅ Text preprocessing & cleaning
✅ TF-IDF / Bag of Words feature extraction
✅ Logistic Regression classifier
✅ Real-time sentiment prediction
✅ Streamlit web interface

🛠 Tech Stack

* Python
* Scikit-learn
* NLP
* Streamlit
* Joblib



